# Outcaster Trailblazer, Plot {2}{G} (CR 702.170): Bot1 pays {2}{G} with three Moxen and exiles it from the hand (a special action, so
# nothing on the stack: no enters trigger yet). It can't be cast the turn it was plotted (the refusal), but on turn 3 it is cast from exile
# for no mana at sorcery speed (the Moxen stay untapped), its enters trigger adds a mana of the chosen color, and it is a 4/2 on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Outcaster Trailblazer
Plains x3
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

